OL,3,GNEWSALibrary to close ahead of move to
OL,4,Anew location
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford's city centre library is to
OL,7,Fclose this weekend as preparations
OL,8,Fbegin for its move to a new location.
OL,10,FThe facility is leaving its current
OL,11,Fhome in the distinctive "banana
OL,12,Fbuilding" in City Park for the
OL,13,Fcouncil-owned Britannia House, where it
OL,14,Fis due to reopen on 7 December.
OL,16,FFirst announced in 2024 by the then
OL,17,FLabour administration, the relocation
OL,18,Fis expected to save the council
OL,19,F#420,000 a year in rent.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
