OL,3,GNEWSALibrary to close ahead of move to
OL,4,Anew location
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said the new premises
OL,7,Fwould provide improved facilities and
OL,8,Foffer space for meetings, exhibitions,
OL,9,Fcultural events and family activities.
